# With two panes, Quick Add from the right pane adds to INBOX and the left pane shows it, the right pane unchanged.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
Work:
	- Email boss
END
keys j j <C-w> v
see 󰋜 › Work
keys q
type From the right
keys <Enter>
see     - From the right
see 󰋜 › Work
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
	- From the right
Work:
	- Email boss
END
